<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORE.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play score on the</p>
<p>second day of a four-day Supersport series cricket match on</p>
<p>Monday:</p>
<p>In East London: Transvaal 291 (Ross Veenstra 135 not out,</p>
<p>Andrew Hall 78; Piet Botha 5-38). Border 35-0.</p>
</text>
